<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_journey> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A process in which a train moves along railway tracks from one railway station to another."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_journey_plan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
