<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_journey_plan> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An information content entity that prescribes or describes an intended rail journey, including planned endpoints or timing, whether or not that journey occurs."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_passenger_role> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
