<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_reservation_information> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Reservation information that records an entitlement to travel by rail on a specified service, independently of any particular material ticket that concretizes it."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_ticket> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
