<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#rail_ticket> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A ticket that is a material information bearer concretizing information that authorizes rail travel."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#railway_station> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
