<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#railway_station> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A building used as a station facility where rail journeys begin, end, or pause so that passengers may board or alight."@en .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#train> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
