<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#train> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030> .
<https://example.org/ontologies/intel-ontology#train> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An object that is a rail vehicle, or a connected consist of rail vehicles, designed to move along railway tracks."@en .
